---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="border-b border-pdw-border bg-pdw-charcoal">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-copper">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 max-w-3xl font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight text-pdw-cream sm:text-4xl">
        Built by a shooter, for shooters
      </h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-pdw-muted">
      <p>
        Peak Defense Works started with a simple problem: nobody was building serious chassis systems for the
        Taurus TX22. Sam set out to change that, designing the TX7-MTN2 from the ground up as the first
        MP7-style chassis to hit the market for the platform. Since launch, thousands have shipped to shooters
        who wanted more control, more stability, and more fun out of a pistol most people underestimated.
      </p>
      <p>
        The company is fully owner-operated. Sam owns the product and the intellectual property outright,
        having walked away from an earlier partnership that wanted a three-way profit split and shared IP
        rights. Every chassis, brace, and accessory on this site is designed, tested, and shipped without
        outside investors or compromises on quality.
      </p>
      <p>
        Design and production happen in central Utah, close to the shooters and range days that shape every
        part. Nothing ships until it has been run under real recoil, not just on a bench.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 border-t border-pdw-border pt-12 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-copper">1st</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-muted">MP7-style chassis for the TX22 to hit the market</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-copper">1000s</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-muted">Chassis systems shipped since launch</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl text-pdw-copper">100%</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-pdw-muted">Designed and machined in Utah</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-pdw-border bg-pdw-charcoal">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-16 text-center lg:px-10">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-cream">Want to see it in person?</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pdw-muted">
        Reach out with questions about fit, availability, or upcoming drops.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="mt-6 inline-block border border-pdw-copper bg-pdw-copper px-6 py-3 font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-pdw-black transition-colors hover:bg-pdw-copper-hover"
      >
        Contact Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
